Z||000001||stimpy||03-01-2000||08:43 AM||||Haven't returned your emails? Hmmmmmm<BR>I hope that you haven't sent them money yet.  One suggestion that I would not make would be holding your breath!  One of the best lessons bought is NEVER do busines with anyone who does not promptly reply to inquiries, whether it is responding to email or answering the phone in first 3 rings. That is one of the best indicators in my book of ones business ethic.<BR>The shop that built my engine answers the phone within 2 rings...always.||||reg||1
